# .facts.staging — SmithtownMap staged facts awaiting test passage and CI ratification.
# Schema-version: 1
#
# WRITE ONLY via `bun run facts:stage` — never by hand (the protect-facts hook blocks
# direct writes). Lifecycle: staged here (tag spec) -> facts:promote after the test is
# green -> facts-bot ratifies into canonical .facts (tag implemented).
#
# Each entry: label (with a verbatim [Source §x] pointer), id, command, tags [spec,...],
# spec back-reference, staged_at, chronology.

- label: "[Scaffold §2a/§2b] ETL parses PastPerfect Dublin Core XML export into
    raw record dicts (accessno→id, dc:title→title, place, image_url, …)"
  id: etl-parse
  command: bun test tests/etl/parse-dublin-core.test.ts
  tags:
    - spec
    - phase1
    - etl
  spec: openspec/changes/data-foundation/specs/data-ingestion/spec.md
  staged_at: 2026-06-17T18:54:06.596Z
  chronology:
    staged_in_commit: pending
- label: "[Scaffold §3e] ETL normalizes a parsed record into the ArchiveRecord
    schema (catalog_type, date_year/date_decade derivation, has_image,
    source=pastperfect_export)"
